WEBVTT

00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:18.800
Okay, done.

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:23.290
Smells good.

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:31.510
<b>Kirio Reiji (24)</b>

00:00:23.970 --> 00:00:27.240
<i>Kirio Reiji. Former corporate drone.</i>

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:28.780
<i>Current isekai resident.</i>

00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:31.720
<i>Skills: evaluation and medicine-making.</i>

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:36.510
Master!

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:39.810
Master, your potions are delicious! Delicious!

00:00:39.810 --> 00:00:43.810
<b>Noela (Werewolf)</b>

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:42.200
<i>Noela. Werewolf.</i>

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:44.350
<i>The shop's poster girl.</i>

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:46.980
Mr. Reiji, Ms. Noela.

00:00:47.330 --> 00:00:50.820
Are you ready? It's almost time.

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:52.500
Got it. Noela?

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:54.180
Woof! I've got this!

00:01:05.030 --> 00:01:07.810
Ms. Noela, could you hang this up, please?

00:01:07.810 --> 00:01:14.340
<b>Mina Fleuret (Ghost)</b>

00:01:08.450 --> 00:01:11.840
<i>Mina Fleuret. The ghost 
who lives in this house.</i>

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:14.340
<i>Shop assistant and housekeeper.</i>

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:15.800
Woof!

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:19.470
<b>Kirio Drugstore</b>

00:01:19.870 --> 00:01:22.090
Another gorgeous day today.

00:01:22.090 --> 00:01:24.430
All right. Kirio Drugstore...

00:01:24.430 --> 00:01:26.020
...is open for the day!

00:01:26.330 --> 00:01:30.020
Let's make another relaxed effort today.

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:30.810
Right?

00:01:30.810 --> 00:01:31.440
Woof!

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:32.100
Right.

00:01:39.240 --> 00:01:43.290
<b>Drugstore</b>

00:01:39.240 --> 00:01:43.290
<b>In Another World</b>

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:12.170
<b>Kirio Drugstore</b>

00:03:04.480 --> 00:03:08.340
Let me know if the roof leaks again.

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:11.560
<b>Today's Prescription: Part 1
 Super (Energy) Potion</b>

00:03:08.340 --> 00:03:09.840
Woof.

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:12.170
Reiji—I mean, Reiji, sir!

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:14.130
<b>General Store
Owner
 Mr. Alf</b>

00:03:12.650 --> 00:03:15.540
Please let me sell your 
product at my general store.

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:16.380
<b>General Store
Owner
 Mr. Alf</b>

00:03:15.810 --> 00:03:17.850
Your "super potion."

00:03:17.850 --> 00:03:20.400
By "super potion," you mean <i>that</i>?

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:21.220
Yes.

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:23.470
Sounds like you came up 
with your own name for it.

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:26.640
Officially, its called an "energy potion."

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:33.650
<b>Super (Energy) Potion</b>

00:03:26.650 --> 00:03:28.190
<i>Energy potion.</i>

00:03:28.190 --> 00:03:31.710
<i>A potion that cures exhaustion 
and causes alertness.</i>

00:03:31.710 --> 00:03:33.650
<i>Effects vary from person to person.</i>

00:03:33.970 --> 00:03:36.770
I've never had a potion that tasted this good!

00:03:36.370 --> 00:03:38.440
Personal space, personal space!

00:03:36.770 --> 00:03:39.030
I was so impressed by it!

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:42.840
Until now, all the potions available 
in this area tasted like garbage.

00:03:42.840 --> 00:03:43.610
Woof?

00:03:43.850 --> 00:03:47.330
We should tell everyone in 
Kalta about this! Please!

00:03:45.630 --> 00:03:47.330
Please, respect my personal space!

00:03:47.650 --> 00:03:52.810
Besides, between you and me, 
my fifth kid is on the way.

00:03:52.810 --> 00:03:53.750
Oh, my.

00:03:54.130 --> 00:03:56.800
My family's financial situation is dire.

00:03:57.540 --> 00:03:59.300
That sounds rough.

00:03:59.300 --> 00:03:59.960
Yeah.

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:01.140
All right, then.

00:04:01.770 --> 00:04:05.240
At this rate, I might have 
to shut down my shop!

00:04:05.240 --> 00:04:08.650
Please allow me to sell your 
super potion at my shop!

00:04:08.650 --> 00:04:09.700
I'm begging you!

00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:11.210
I said it's fine.

00:04:10.150 --> 00:04:12.200
I know, I know.

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:19.060
I know your potion is too good for 
a backwater general store like mine.

00:04:19.060 --> 00:04:22.370
But I have every intention 
of making a comeback.

00:04:22.370 --> 00:04:25.110
How many do you think you'll need to start?

00:04:25.110 --> 00:04:28.100
For now, 20... no, 25, probably.

00:04:28.840 --> 00:04:31.700
Wait. Are you saying I can sell them?

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:34.960
Mr. Reiji has been saying it's fine.

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:35.370
What?!

00:04:35.860 --> 00:04:37.270
I appreciate it!

00:04:37.270 --> 00:04:39.770
Now I'll be able to raise my fifth kid.

00:04:39.770 --> 00:04:42.800
No, I could have even more.

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:44.360
Thank you, Reiji!

00:04:44.360 --> 00:04:46.220
That's great, but please 
respect my personal space!

00:04:46.560 --> 00:04:50.430
I'm off to aggressively 
promote this super potion.

00:04:50.700 --> 00:04:52.430
I'll sell a boatload of these.

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:54.450
Thank you.

00:04:54.450 --> 00:04:55.390
Woof.

00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:58.910
He's as intense as ever.

00:04:58.910 --> 00:05:06.530
So... Each bottle costs 2,000 rin, so the 
total for 25 bottles comes to 50,000 rin.

00:05:06.530 --> 00:05:12.080
But Mr. Reiji, don't you think 
you sold those too cheaply?

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:12.870
It's fine.

00:05:13.300 --> 00:05:16.580
Mr. Alf helped me when I opened this shop.

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:20.100
I just hope this helps ease his 
family's financial situation.

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:21.860
He'll be fine.

00:05:21.860 --> 00:05:24.740
I know your potions will sell.

00:05:24.740 --> 00:05:27.050
Your potions are delicious, master!

00:05:27.360 --> 00:05:29.110
Thanks.

00:05:29.110 --> 00:05:32.080
I think this might be the first time 
I've received this much praise.

00:05:32.080 --> 00:05:34.770
It was inconceivable before.

00:05:36.010 --> 00:05:37.470
<i>After this day,</i>

00:05:37.990 --> 00:05:42.840
<i>rumors about my potions spread throughout 
the town of Kalta like wildfire.</i>

00:05:38.310 --> 00:05:43.320
<b>Town of Kalta</b>

00:05:44.390 --> 00:05:46.850
A potion that doesn't taste like garbage?

00:05:46.850 --> 00:05:47.990
It's delicious!

00:05:48.420 --> 00:05:49.720
It's so tasty.

00:05:49.720 --> 00:05:50.600
So good.

00:05:50.600 --> 00:05:52.030
Intensely good.

00:05:52.030 --> 00:05:53.990
Unbelievably good.

00:05:53.990 --> 00:05:59.800
<b>Alf's 
General Store</b>

00:05:54.780 --> 00:05:59.800
<i>Hordes of customers came to Mr. Alf's 
drugstore every day to buy potions.</i>

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:00.580
Okay, okay.

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:02.540
Get in line, everyone.

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:05.510
It's limited to one per customer.

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:08.990
This is the first time we've 
gotten this many customers.

00:06:06.070 --> 00:06:08.990
One at a time, please.

00:06:08.990 --> 00:06:10.730
Nice work, honey.

00:06:10.730 --> 00:06:11.810
I suppose.

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:15.560
<b>Kirio Drugstore</b>

00:06:12.920 --> 00:06:14.960
<i>They even came to my shop.</i>

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:17.400
Thank you for waiting.

00:06:17.400 --> 00:06:17.970
Woof.

00:06:17.970 --> 00:06:18.640
Thanks.

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:19.520
Take care.

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:21.610
<b>Micott
(Energetic Girl)</b>

00:06:19.740 --> 00:06:21.610
Thank you. I'll be back.

00:06:21.940 --> 00:06:22.980
See you later.

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:24.900
Next customer, please.

00:06:25.380 --> 00:06:27.120
That's me.

00:06:27.120 --> 00:06:31.480
Mom, I'm tired. Let's go home.

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:33.830
We're almost done, okay?

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:35.980
I wanna go home!

00:06:34.670 --> 00:06:35.980
Now, now...

00:06:35.980 --> 00:06:38.000
I'm so sorry.

00:06:38.450 --> 00:06:41.670
It's all right. You must be tired of waiting.

00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:42.760
Sorry about that.

00:06:44.280 --> 00:06:47.340
I wanna go home! I wanna go home!
Home! Home! Home!

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:48.670
Master's in trouble.

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:52.720
I'm tired! I wanna go home! Home!

00:06:54.690 --> 00:06:57.650
Woof, woof, woof. Here's my tail.

00:06:57.650 --> 00:06:59.010
Oh, my.

00:07:00.290 --> 00:07:01.600
Woof, woof, woof.

00:07:02.970 --> 00:07:03.520
Woof!

00:07:03.950 --> 00:07:06.330
Could you please confirm your order?

00:07:06.330 --> 00:07:07.860
Thank you.

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:10.160
Woof, woof, woof.

00:07:09.100 --> 00:07:10.160
Gotcha!

00:07:10.160 --> 00:07:13.490
Your tail is so fluffy. Fluffy!

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:14.880
<i>Oh, no!</i>

00:07:14.880 --> 00:07:17.020
<i>If anyone other than me grabs Noela's tail...</i>

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:21.710
<i>Sorry, Noela.</i>

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:25.170
Hey, Fluffy, are you always here?

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:28.420
Yeah. Master saved my life.

00:07:28.790 --> 00:07:32.750
So I'll help him here forever.

00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:33.990
Master?

00:07:33.990 --> 00:07:35.220
I'm finished.

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:36.460
Let's go.

00:07:36.460 --> 00:07:38.020
Thank you for waiting.

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:41.210
Mommy, I wanna come back and see Fluffy.

00:07:41.210 --> 00:07:43.650
Sure, let's come back sometime.

00:07:44.140 --> 00:07:46.400
Bye-bye!

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:47.760
Woof.

00:07:48.570 --> 00:07:51.120
Noela, you were very patient with her.

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:53.280
It was a huge help.

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:54.190
Thanks.

00:07:54.190 --> 00:07:56.740
Master praised me!

00:07:56.740 --> 00:07:59.910
Mr. Reiji, are you ready 
for your next customer?

00:07:59.910 --> 00:08:01.660
Yeah, send them in.

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:02.500
Woof!

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:05.510
Thank you for waiting. Next customer, please.

00:08:07.690 --> 00:08:09.800
Mr. Reiji, good work today.

00:08:10.110 --> 00:08:11.360
Thanks.

00:08:11.360 --> 00:08:14.050
Ms. Noela, would you like some tea, too? Huh?

00:08:15.660 --> 00:08:16.970
Noela!

00:08:21.260 --> 00:08:23.280
You were sneaking potions again!

00:08:24.990 --> 00:08:27.800
Master's potions are delicious.

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:30.860
Even so, you shouldn't drink too many.

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:32.080
I'm putting these away.

00:08:32.080 --> 00:08:33.200
Woof...

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:35.230
It's for your own good, Ms. Noela.

00:08:35.230 --> 00:08:36.250
Woof.

00:08:36.250 --> 00:08:40.450
Oh, I almost forgot. Mr. Reiji, 
could you go shopping for me later?

00:08:40.850 --> 00:08:41.340
Huh?

00:08:41.340 --> 00:08:44.030
I'm running low on ingredients.

00:08:44.030 --> 00:08:45.080
Yeah, sure.

00:08:45.550 --> 00:08:47.080
Maybe I'll go right now.

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:48.500
Would you?

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:51.670
I wrote down what I need.
Could you get these?

00:08:52.080 --> 00:08:53.280
Got it.

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:55.040
Noela, wanna come?

00:08:55.500 --> 00:08:56.680
Woof!

00:08:57.230 --> 00:08:58.430
See you later.

00:08:58.670 --> 00:08:59.720
Be careful.

00:08:59.720 --> 00:09:01.450
I promise we'll be back!

00:09:01.450 --> 00:09:03.030
Where do you think we're going?

00:09:04.180 --> 00:09:06.870
Woof, woof. Woof, woof.

00:09:04.450 --> 00:09:09.040
<b>Today's Prescription: Part 2
 Landenflower Tea</b>

00:09:06.870 --> 00:09:12.040
Woof. Woof woof, woof.

00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:14.320
Woof! Master, master!

00:09:15.890 --> 00:09:17.410
Can you use this?

00:09:17.130 --> 00:09:19.200
<b>Tougirisou</b>

00:09:20.290 --> 00:09:23.040
That's tougirisou. It's a useful herb.

00:09:24.770 --> 00:09:25.510
Woof!

00:09:25.510 --> 00:09:26.470
Thanks, Noela.

00:09:26.470 --> 00:09:26.710
Woof!

00:09:27.060 --> 00:09:28.660
Master, how about this?

00:09:28.660 --> 00:09:31.720
That's amane. Its roots can 
be used to make medicine.

00:09:31.720 --> 00:09:33.670
Master, how about this?

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:34.640
That one is...

00:09:36.150 --> 00:09:40.440
<i>I see. Noela acts on instinct 
when she's doing this.</i>

00:09:41.080 --> 00:09:43.520
<i>When Noela and I met...</i>

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:47.550
Hey! Hey! Are you okay?

00:09:51.340 --> 00:09:53.020
<i>She was a wolf.</i>

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:56.830
Come to think of it, 
what did Mina want us to buy?

00:09:57.490 --> 00:09:58.570
What is this?!

00:09:59.020 --> 00:10:00.780
Wool panties?!

00:10:01.100 --> 00:10:03.720
She wants me to buy panties for her?

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:08.510
Wait, ghosts wear wool panties, too?

00:10:08.510 --> 00:10:10.050
They're so warm.

00:10:10.050 --> 00:10:13.240
Even ghosts should wear wool panties.

00:10:13.240 --> 00:10:14.500
Right?

00:10:15.730 --> 00:10:17.210
Master, what's wrong?

00:10:17.210 --> 00:10:17.550
Huh?

00:10:17.550 --> 00:10:18.760
Your face is red.

00:10:19.050 --> 00:10:20.570
Uh, it's nothing.

00:10:20.570 --> 00:10:23.990
Looks like Mina gave me the wrong note.

00:10:23.990 --> 00:10:24.620
Woof?

00:10:24.620 --> 00:10:25.490
Come on.

00:10:25.490 --> 00:10:26.810
Someone help!

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:28.180
Wait! Stop!

00:10:28.180 --> 00:10:30.140
No! Stay away!

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:32.440
Why are you running?

00:10:34.210 --> 00:10:35.640
I sense a fight.

00:10:35.640 --> 00:10:37.610
I'll protect you, master.

00:10:37.610 --> 00:10:39.620
Please, don't be so dramatic...

00:10:41.560 --> 00:10:43.490
Wait! Stop!

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:47.040
Why are you running away from me?

00:10:47.270 --> 00:10:49.000
Huh?! O-Oh crap, oh crap, oh crap!

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:50.660
She looks like trouble!

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:50.660
I'll protect you, master.

00:10:50.660 --> 00:10:51.750
No, we're running!

00:10:53.140 --> 00:10:54.550
Help me!

00:10:53.740 --> 00:10:56.230
No way! Handle it yourself!

00:10:56.230 --> 00:10:57.370
Help me!

00:10:57.370 --> 00:10:59.430
Please do something about her!

00:10:57.960 --> 00:10:59.120
What?! But—

00:11:02.330 --> 00:11:05.010
Why are you running?

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:06.340
Master!

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:09.000
<i>Why me?</i>

00:11:07.970 --> 00:11:10.940
<b>Drugstore in Another World</b>

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:21.900
U-Uh, my name's Kirio Reiji.

00:11:21.900 --> 00:11:24.400
I run a nearby drugstore.

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:25.560
A drugstore?

00:11:26.090 --> 00:11:29.580
Ah, you must be the alchemist 
I've heard about.

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:31.590
Which means it's your fault!

00:11:31.590 --> 00:11:34.560
How could you do that to Zeral?!

00:11:33.480 --> 00:11:35.120
Master didn't do anything!

00:11:35.120 --> 00:11:36.300
Let go of that!

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:39.720
Noela, try not to provoke her, okay?

00:11:40.410 --> 00:11:43.080
Hey! Don't just hide! Say something!

00:11:43.080 --> 00:11:44.980
Feris is a little bit crazy.

00:11:44.980 --> 00:11:47.320
Please do something, alchemist.

00:11:47.320 --> 00:11:48.650
Seriously?

00:11:50.260 --> 00:11:53.440
I'm not crazy! I'm not crazy! I'm not crazy!

00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:57.210
The crazy one is you, you, you!

00:11:56.480 --> 00:11:58.340
See? Crazy, right?

00:11:57.210 --> 00:12:01.220
I'm not crazy! I'm not crazy!
You are! You are! You are!

00:11:58.650 --> 00:12:01.220
<i>I'm caught in the middle of this now.</i>

00:12:01.220 --> 00:12:10.000
I'm not crazy! I'm not crazy! I'm not crazy!

00:12:01.840 --> 00:12:03.900
Fine, fine.

00:12:03.900 --> 00:12:05.560
I get it, okay?

00:12:05.560 --> 00:12:08.540
Feris, just put down the knife.

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:10.380
Then we can talk, okay?

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:29.310
Master, I'll put this away.

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:30.350
Thanks.

00:12:30.350 --> 00:12:33.480
It's not my fault! It's not 
my fault! It's not my fault!

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:34.820
Uh, Feris?

00:12:33.480 --> 00:12:36.060
Why does everyone always 
speak so poorly of me?

00:12:35.620 --> 00:12:36.480
Fe—

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:44.570
Why? Why, why, why? It's not my fault!

00:12:37.280 --> 00:12:38.380
Excuse me.

00:12:41.300 --> 00:12:44.570
It's no use! I'm not getting anywhere!

00:12:46.610 --> 00:12:49.410
Could you explain the situation?

00:12:51.650 --> 00:12:52.900
Y-Yes?

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:56.330
Wh-Why?!

00:12:58.800 --> 00:13:03.220
Woof, woof. Woof, woof.

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:01.520
There, there.

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:03.220
Feris and I recently began dating.

00:13:03.220 --> 00:13:06.220
<b>Zeral
(Feris's
Boyfriend)</b>

00:13:03.220 --> 00:13:06.220
We're, well... lovers.

00:13:06.530 --> 00:13:07.890
Uh-huh...

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:10.600
<b>Feris
 (Zeral's
 Girlfriend)</b>

00:13:11.030 --> 00:13:12.910
So, did you have a fight?

00:13:12.910 --> 00:13:16.980
Not a fight, exactly. Lately,
it's been happening frequently.

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:17.940
Frequently?

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:20.720
Feris worries a lot.

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:24.020
I guess you could say 
she worries excessively.

00:13:24.020 --> 00:13:24.960
Okay...

00:13:25.500 --> 00:13:29.300
She's so worried about me that 
she can't even sleep at night.

00:13:29.300 --> 00:13:30.210
I see.

00:13:30.210 --> 00:13:34.000
The other day, when I went to buy bread, 
there was a girl at the shop...

00:13:32.880 --> 00:13:34.640
Thank you.

00:13:34.640 --> 00:13:35.210
Thanks.

00:13:36.950 --> 00:13:37.920
Feri—

00:13:36.950 --> 00:13:40.280
Zeral, who is she?! She's your 
new girlfriend, isn't she?!

00:13:39.830 --> 00:13:43.230
No! I was just buying bread!

00:13:40.280 --> 00:13:43.230
Huh? Huh? Huh? Isn't she? Isn't she?!

00:13:43.230 --> 00:13:46.170
Even if I just bump into 
a girl in the street...

00:13:48.270 --> 00:13:49.240
Excuse me.

00:13:49.240 --> 00:13:49.960
Sorry.

00:13:49.960 --> 00:13:52.010
Hold up!

00:13:52.010 --> 00:13:55.750
What was that, huh? Was that on purpose?

00:13:54.820 --> 00:13:56.070
What? Uh...

00:13:56.070 --> 00:13:59.390
Is this the start of a new romance?

00:13:58.530 --> 00:14:01.130
No! We just...

00:14:01.130 --> 00:14:04.050
"We"? Huh? What?!

00:14:04.490 --> 00:14:05.500
I'm telling you...

00:14:09.430 --> 00:14:12.180
Why don't you break up with her?

00:14:12.180 --> 00:14:13.910
Haven't you had enough?

00:14:15.220 --> 00:14:20.710
Mr. Reiji, do you want to know what 
happened when I suggested we break up?

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:22.290
I'll pass.

00:14:23.730 --> 00:14:30.230
But when I see her acting like that,
I realize that normally she's really cute.

00:14:26.950 --> 00:14:29.000
So fluffy.

00:14:30.230 --> 00:14:31.960
Seems like it.

00:14:35.090 --> 00:14:37.480
<i>Noela, I'm really sorry.</i>

00:14:39.420 --> 00:14:44.090
Mr. Reiji, there must be 
something evil possessing her!

00:14:44.090 --> 00:14:47.950
Please exorcise whatever 
evil is possessing her!

00:14:46.130 --> 00:14:47.950
Hey, personal space!

00:14:47.950 --> 00:14:50.210
I'm a pharmacist! That's not my domain!

00:14:50.210 --> 00:14:52.630
Please help Feris!

00:14:52.630 --> 00:14:55.660
Helping her would help me, too!

00:14:57.270 --> 00:15:01.000
Very well. I'll do what I can.

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:04.790
Really? Thank you, Mr. Reiji!

00:15:05.230 --> 00:15:06.520
Woof!

00:15:12.130 --> 00:15:14.450
That's amazing, Noela!

00:15:15.450 --> 00:15:17.140
Mr. Reiji, what do you think?

00:15:19.470 --> 00:15:23.280
In her current state, 
she looks like an ordinary girl.

00:15:23.690 --> 00:15:26.430
It's possible <i>that</i> could help her.

00:15:26.430 --> 00:15:27.070
"That"?

00:15:28.450 --> 00:15:29.910
I'll prepare it right away.

00:15:29.910 --> 00:15:32.340
Come to Kirio Drugstore tonight.

00:15:32.340 --> 00:15:35.080
What? Wait, you're leaving?!

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:37.080
You're leaving me alone with Feris?

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:38.860
She's <i>your</i> girlfriend.

00:15:38.860 --> 00:15:40.910
Deal with that yourself!

00:15:41.410 --> 00:15:43.950
Noela, we're leaving.

00:15:45.090 --> 00:15:48.430
Woof, got it. See you later.

00:15:48.430 --> 00:15:50.690
Okay. See you later, Noela.

00:15:50.690 --> 00:15:51.340
Please...

00:15:52.060 --> 00:15:55.430
Please let Feris stay this way until tonight.

00:15:55.430 --> 00:15:58.010
<b>Kirio Drugstore</b>

00:15:56.010 --> 00:15:58.010
You were gone an awfully long time.

00:15:58.670 --> 00:16:00.840
We got caught up in something.

00:16:00.840 --> 00:16:03.610
Also, I don't think this was the right one.

00:16:03.610 --> 00:16:04.310
Huh?

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:09.320
I'm sorry! I gave you the wrong note!

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:10.490
I thought so.

00:16:11.900 --> 00:16:12.730
Ow.

00:16:13.820 --> 00:16:16.850
Woof? What does this say?

00:16:16.850 --> 00:16:18.280
"Wool panties."

00:16:18.280 --> 00:16:21.000
Please don't!

00:16:19.270 --> 00:16:21.000
Wool panties?

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:23.170
Not you, too!

00:16:23.990 --> 00:16:27.020
Now, where did I put that?

00:16:27.020 --> 00:16:29.380
Ah, here it is.

00:16:29.380 --> 00:16:31.800
Master, here are the herbs I picked earlier.

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:33.160
Thanks.

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:36.270
Okay, that's everything. Let's begin.

00:16:36.270 --> 00:16:37.200
Woof!

00:16:57.660 --> 00:17:00.410
<b>Kirio Drugstore</b>

00:16:58.370 --> 00:17:00.410
Mr. Reiji, is it ready?

00:17:01.940 --> 00:17:04.330
I see... So what kind of medicine is this?

00:17:04.640 --> 00:17:07.350
It's more like a drink than a medicine.

00:17:07.350 --> 00:17:12.750
I get it! If Feris drinks this, it will 
exorcise whatever evil is possessing her!

00:17:12.750 --> 00:17:14.300
Well, actually...

00:17:14.520 --> 00:17:17.010
I'll return this instant 
and have her drink it!

00:17:17.010 --> 00:17:19.400
Thank you!

00:17:19.400 --> 00:17:22.310
Have her drink it before bedtime.

00:17:22.310 --> 00:17:24.980
Thank you.

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:26.150
Woof.

00:17:26.150 --> 00:17:29.090
Noela, thanks for today.

00:17:29.090 --> 00:17:31.410
Woof! I worked hard!

00:17:33.330 --> 00:17:36.320
I forgot to give him his prescription.

00:17:37.400 --> 00:17:38.890
You can do that tomorrow.

00:17:38.890 --> 00:17:40.770
Let's close up shop for today.

00:17:42.950 --> 00:17:45.080
<b>The Next Day</b>

00:17:45.080 --> 00:17:46.870
It's an emergency, Mr. Reiji!

00:17:47.120 --> 00:17:48.550
What? An emergency?

00:17:48.550 --> 00:17:50.290
When I woke up this morning, Feris was...

00:17:50.290 --> 00:17:51.630
Feris was...?

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:53.960
...wearing an incredibly calm expression, and...

00:17:53.960 --> 00:17:55.760
And?

00:17:55.760 --> 00:17:59.660
...was back to being my former cute Feris.

00:17:59.660 --> 00:18:02.350
I see. That's great news.

00:18:02.350 --> 00:18:03.520
Uh-huh.

00:18:03.520 --> 00:18:05.310
Your medicines always work, master.

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:09.960
That medicine must've exorcised whatever 
demon was possessing her. I know it.

00:18:09.960 --> 00:18:12.360
Actually, you don't get it at all.

00:18:12.360 --> 00:18:12.900
Huh?

00:18:13.200 --> 00:18:16.070
It's just a tea to help her relax.

00:18:16.480 --> 00:18:18.280
Here's the prescription.

00:18:18.450 --> 00:18:27.250
<b>Landenflower Tea</b>

00:18:18.930 --> 00:18:20.590
<i>Landenflower tea.</i>

00:18:20.590 --> 00:18:27.250
<i>Soothes the nerves and relaxes the patient, 
alleviating their anxiety and irritation.</i>

00:18:27.480 --> 00:18:29.100
It's just tea?

00:18:29.100 --> 00:18:29.710
Yes.

00:18:30.290 --> 00:18:33.250
You said Feris couldn't sleep at night,

00:18:33.650 --> 00:18:37.050
so I looked for something soothing 
that would help her sleep.

00:18:37.410 --> 00:18:42.560
Lack of sleep can make a person 
irritable or emotionally unstable.

00:18:43.540 --> 00:18:47.200
Thank goodness. So it wasn't a demon.

00:18:47.200 --> 00:18:49.230
Zeral!

00:18:49.610 --> 00:18:50.690
Are you done yet?

00:18:50.690 --> 00:18:51.600
Hey.

00:18:51.600 --> 00:18:53.020
Feris, you came!

00:18:52.210 --> 00:18:53.020
Hello.

00:18:53.020 --> 00:18:54.520
Noela!

00:18:54.520 --> 00:18:55.560
Woof!

00:18:56.170 --> 00:18:58.140
We're going on a date now.

00:18:58.140 --> 00:19:00.030
Oh, really?

00:19:00.030 --> 00:19:01.240
Also, here.

00:19:02.060 --> 00:19:03.200
Your fee.

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:05.900
What? This is too much.

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:09.200
I'm actually the son of the Alonzo family.

00:19:09.200 --> 00:19:11.400
We're famous landowners around here.

00:19:11.400 --> 00:19:12.490
Oh...

00:19:12.490 --> 00:19:14.670
I've got tons of money, if nothing else.

00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:15.270
Ah.

00:19:15.270 --> 00:19:16.480
Take the cash.

00:19:17.080 --> 00:19:18.300
You're a rich kid, huh?

00:19:18.720 --> 00:19:20.670
See you next time.

00:19:20.670 --> 00:19:22.760
See you later.

00:19:22.760 --> 00:19:25.020
Let's go.

00:19:23.090 --> 00:19:25.250
Take care.

00:19:25.250 --> 00:19:27.700
You're so cute, Feris.

00:19:28.570 --> 00:19:35.240
Damn normie enjoying a fulfilling 
life. I hope he explodes.

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:33.770
Mina, master is emotionally unstable.

00:19:33.770 --> 00:19:35.220
Oh, my.

00:19:35.220 --> 00:19:38.740
Mr. Reiji, have some landenflower tea.

00:19:42.110 --> 00:19:43.170
I feel calm.

00:19:43.170 --> 00:19:44.870
It's super effective.

00:19:44.870 --> 00:19:48.160
Woof. Master, relax.

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:59.030
<b>Today's Prescription: Part 3
 Botanical Deodorant</b>

00:19:54.130 --> 00:19:55.230
Master...

00:19:55.700 --> 00:19:56.440
Stinky.

00:19:56.440 --> 00:19:58.050
What? You mean me?

00:19:58.890 --> 00:20:01.420
There's something weird over there.

00:20:03.070 --> 00:20:08.970
<b>Utsubo Flower</b>

00:20:03.410 --> 00:20:04.890
<i>Utsubo flower.</i>

00:20:04.890 --> 00:20:08.970
<i>A flower that produces an unpleasant 
smell that only monsters can detect.</i>

00:20:08.970 --> 00:20:13.380
I see. I can't smell it because I'm a human.

00:20:15.530 --> 00:20:17.150
Do your eyes hurt?

00:20:17.150 --> 00:20:18.150
Yes.

00:20:18.620 --> 00:20:21.520
Sometimes strong smells affect the eyes.

00:20:21.520 --> 00:20:22.860
In that case...

00:20:31.050 --> 00:20:31.960
That should do it.

00:20:32.250 --> 00:20:38.420
<b>Botanical Deodorant</b>

00:20:32.550 --> 00:20:34.490
<i>Botanical deodorant.</i>

00:20:34.490 --> 00:20:38.420
<i>A natural deodorant made 
from 100% plant products.</i>

00:20:45.780 --> 00:20:46.930
How's that, Noela?

00:20:49.970 --> 00:20:51.770
Woof. The smell is gone.

00:20:51.770 --> 00:20:54.800
Gone, gone! The smell is gone!

00:20:54.800 --> 00:20:56.210
Woof, woof!

00:20:56.210 --> 00:20:58.520
Mr. Reiji, we could sell this.

00:20:58.520 --> 00:21:00.130
You think so?

00:21:00.130 --> 00:21:01.480
Definitely.

00:21:01.870 --> 00:21:03.680
If you insist.

00:21:03.680 --> 00:21:05.510
<i>Mina was right.</i>

00:21:05.510 --> 00:21:10.030
<i>The botanical deodorant was a 
huge hit as a bathroom deodorant.</i>

00:21:10.030 --> 00:21:12.960
<i>It became our second most popular 
product after my super potion.</i>

00:21:22.980 --> 00:21:26.220
Ouch... Oh, right.

00:21:26.470 --> 00:21:29.710
Perhaps I'll try this potion 
everyone's talking about.

00:21:34.180 --> 00:21:36.140
Saw!

00:21:38.410 --> 00:21:39.970
Wow.

00:21:40.530 --> 00:21:41.910
What is that?

00:21:41.910 --> 00:21:43.820
How marvelous.

00:21:42.600 --> 00:21:43.820
Woof.

00:21:43.820 --> 00:21:45.490
<b>Closing Time</b>

00:21:46.010 --> 00:21:46.950
Kirio Drugstore.

00:21:47.270 --> 00:21:48.110
Thank you...

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:50.070
...for visiting...

00:21:50.390 --> 00:21:52.470
...again today.

00:21:52.470 --> 00:21:53.910
Woof.

00:21:54.730 --> 00:21:58.960
Hey, I finished the repairs.

00:21:59.190 --> 00:22:01.050
What? You're finished?

00:22:00.500 --> 00:22:04.920
<b>Next Customer</b>

00:22:01.050 --> 00:22:04.060
At the rate you were going,
I thought it'd take half a year.

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Illustration by: BORUMETE @BORUMETE</b>
